button" class="launch-cta" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wallet" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"></path></svg>Connect wallet<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down wallet-menu-caret" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><div id="page-content" class="app-content"><article class="hk-doc hk-card"><header class="hk-doc-head"><p class="hk-kicker"><span>[--]</span><span>Risks</span><i></i><span>Updated <!-- -->27 Oct 2026</span></p><h1>Risks</h1></header><div class="hk-doc-body"><p>Trading memecoins is highly risky. Read this before you launch or trade, and only use money you can afford to lose entirely.</p><h2>Coins can go to zero</h2><p>Most memecoins lose almost all of their value. A coin’s price can fall sharply within seconds, and there may be no one to buy from you at the price you want. Past prices say nothing about future ones.</p><h2>Anyone can create a coin</h2><p>Hokori doesn’t review coins or their creators. A coin’s name, ticker and image can imitate a person, a brand or another coin. Check the coin’s address, which always ends in <code>DAB</code>, before you trade.</p><h2>Price impact, slippage and the launch window</h2><p>Large trades move the price; the quote shows the price impact and the least you’ll receive. Buys in a coin’s first two blocks pay a 99% fee by design, and the page holds buys through that window.</p><h2>Smart contracts can fail</h2><p>Hokori runs on smart contracts that have been tested and reviewed internally. Contracts can still contain bugs. Pools live on Ekubo, whose own contracts can be upgraded by Ekubo’s governance.</p><h2>Networks and wallets</h2><p>Starknet, its RPC nodes and your wallet can be slow or unavailable. Transactions can’t be reversed once they’re accepted, and every transaction costs a network fee in STRK, including one that fails.</p><h2>What you publish is permanent</h2><p>A coin’s image and details are stored on Arweave and can’t be deleted.</p><h2>A coin can be hidden from Hokori</h2><p>Hokori screens coins’ images and text and may hide a coin from the website, as the <a href="/terms">terms</a> describe. A hidden coin and its contracts stay on Starknet and can still be traded elsewhere; Hokori just stops showing it.</p><h2>Rules where you live</h2><p>Crypto assets may be restricted where you live, and you’re responsible for following your local laws and taxes. See the <a href="/terms">terms of service</a>.</p></div><div class="hk-doc-actions"><a href="/" class="hk-back" aria-label="Back"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="7.5,2.5 4,6 7.5,9.5"></polyline></svg></span>Back</a></div></article></div><div class="app-content hk-footer-wrap"><footer class="hk-footer"><div class="hk-footer-top"><div class="hk-footer-brand"><div class="hk-footer-logo"><button type="button" class="hok-flower" aria-label="Scatter the flower seeds" title="Scatter the seeds" style="width:36px;height:36px"><canvas aria-hidden="true" style="left:-36px;top:-36px;width:108px;height:108px"></canvas></button><strong>Hokori<span>.fun</span></strong></div></div><nav class="hk-footer-links" aria-label="Footer"><div><h2>Product</h2><ul><li><a href="/">Trade</a></li><li><a href="/launch">Launch a coin</a></li><li><a href="/transparency">Transparency</a></li></ul></div><di